data: {"id": "6dc4920ad6f244db-node_complete-layer", "run_id": "6dc4920ad6f244db", "seq": 16, "ts_ms": 1789119624663, "node": "layer", "node_name": "问题定位", "duration_seconds": 17.033, "state_snapshot": {"layer": "Layer.ABNORMAL", "layers": ["ABNORMAL"], "layer_confidence": 0.5, "layer_reasoning": "集群中存在一个异常 Pod `workload` (Namespace: `aiops-case-v04`)。该 Pod 处于 `ContainerCreating` 状态。根据 `kubectl get events` 的原始数据，Pod 持续报错 `FailedMount: MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : secret \"unavailable-input\" not found`。进一步通过 `kubectl get secret unavailable-input` 验证确认该 Secret 确实不存在。这表明 Pod 定义的 volume 引用的 Secret 资源缺失，导致卷挂载失败。根据 Runbook，此类情况属于 `VolumeMountFailed` 类型（具体原因为 ConfigMap/Secret volume 缺失）。", "layer_analysis": "{\"layer\": \"DIAGNOSIS\", \"derived_layer\": \"\", \"layers\": [], \"layer_name\": \"\", \"confidence\": 0.5, \"reasoning\": \"集群中存在一个异常 Pod `workload` (Namespace: `aiops-case-v04`)。该 Pod 处于 `ContainerCreating` 状态。根据 `kubectl get events` 的原始数据，Pod 持续报错 `FailedMount: MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \\\"input\\\" : secret \\\"unavailable-input\\\" not found`。进一步通过 `kubectl get secret unavailable-input` 验证确认该 Secret 确实不存在。这表明 Pod 定义的 volume 引用的 Secret 资源缺失，导致卷挂载失败。根据 Runbook，此类情况属于 `VolumeMountFailed` 类型（具体原因为 ConfigMap/Secret volume 缺失）。\", \"abnormal_pods\": [{\"name\": \"workload\", \"namespace\": \"aiops-case-v04\", \"status\": \"ContainerCreating\"}], \"pod_status_keyword\": \"ContainerCreating\", \"pod_abnormal_type\": \"VolumeMountFailed\", \"status_category\": \"ABNORMAL\", \"key_entities\": [{\"type\": \"Pod\", \"name\": \"workload\", \"namespace\": \"aiops-case-v04\"}, {\"type\": \"Secret\", \"name\": \"unavailable-input\", \"namespace\": \"aiops-case-v04\"}], \"possible_scenarios\": [{\"scenario\": \"Pod VolumeMountFailed: 引用的 Secret 'unavailable-input' 不存在\", \"probability\": \"High\", \"reason\": \"Events 显示 FailedMount，且直接查询确认 Secret 不存在 (NotFound)。\"}], \"abnormal_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"g1\", \"status_keywords\": [\"ContainerCr