event: thinking
data: {"id": "6dc4920ad6f244db-thinking-parallel_evidence-633", "run_id": "6dc4920ad6f244db", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "Now I have all the evidence needed. Let me summarize:\n\n**已采集事实**：\n\n1. **Pod 状态**：`aiops-case-v04/workload` 处于 `Pending` 阶段（Prometheus 显示 `kube_pod_status_phase=Pending`），容器 `app` 处于 `ContainerCreating` 等待状态，等待原因为 `ContainerCreating`（`kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason`），重启次数为 0。\n\n2. **核心事件**（来自 `kubectl describe`）：\n   - `Warning FailedMount` (x23 over 37m)：`MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : secret \"unavailable-input\" not found`\n   - `Warning FailedMount` (x16 over 35m)：`Unable ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1789119651693, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "6dc4920ad6f244db-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "6dc4920ad6f244db", "seq": 634, "ts_ms": 1789119659517, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 34.853, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-v04", "name": "workload"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/6dc4920ad6f244db-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "780c99a1444e1a1d9226747875c57b4c30b657c6596265512caa479d9fd925f5", "bytes": 2420}, "snapshot_sha256": "27ae2a4273de9513c4f0c01046fa6d6fdba9e75b4844c9f9822405a90ba58d69"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "6dc4920ad6f244db-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "6dc4920ad6f244db", "seq": 635, "ts_ms": 1789119659518, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "6dc4920ad6f244db-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "6dc4920ad6f244db", "seq": 636, "ts_ms": 1789119671685, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 12.167, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 2187, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v04/workload` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload in aiops-case-v04 is stuck in ContainerCreating/Pending state |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning FailedMount ... MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : secret \"unavailable-input\" not found` (fact-258ab1cb9337) | 核心根因证据：明确报错 Secret 缺失导致挂载失败 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning FailedMount ... Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input], unattached volumes=[input]: timed out waiting for the condition` (fact-17e97072e3f8) | 佐证机制：确认挂载动作因 volume 条件未满足而超时 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | `pod.phase: Pending` (fact-725956be3194) | 现象证据：Pod 因资源/依赖未就绪处于挂起状态 |\n| 4 | K8s State | kubernetes | `pod.condition.ContainersReady: False, reason: ContainersNotReady` (fact-7385412b46cb) | 现象证据：确认容器未进入 Ready 状态 |\n| 5 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason: ContainerCreating` (fact-31c26ed34658) | 现象证据：容器处于等待就绪的中间状态 |\n| 6 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason[reason=\"ContainerCreating\"] = 1` (fact-0e9f3a9a30a3) | 现象佐证：监控确认容器持续处于 ContainerCreating 状态 |\n\n**证据印证**：\nKubernetes 事件直接指出了失败的具体对象是名为 `unavailable-input` 的 Secret，且错误原因为 `not found` (证据 #1, #2)。Pod 的状态数据与指标数据 (证据 #3-6) 一致表明 Pod 停滞在 `ContainerCreating` 和 `Pending` 阶段，未发生任何重试或重启 (restart_count: 0)，这符合因静态配置缺陷（Secret 缺失）导致的不可恢复故障特征。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 的 'input' Volume 引用了不存在的 Secret 'unavailable-input' (Optional: false)\n→ Kubelet 挂载卷时因 Secret 缺失返回 \"not found\" 错误 (FailedMount)\n→ Pod 因依赖卷挂载失败被调度器或 Kubelet 判定为不可启动 (Pending/ContainerCreating)\n→ 用户/集群观测到该 Pod 持续停滞，无法进入 Running 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因：Pod `aiops-case-v04/workload` 声明了对 Secret `unavailable-input` 的挂载依赖，但该 Secret 在集群中不存在。**\n\n根据事实 `fact-258ab1cb9337`，Kubelet 明确记录了 `secret \"unavailable-input\" not found` 的挂载失败事件。由于该 Volume 配置中 `Optional` 标志为 `false`（隐含在 `not found` 导致阻断的行为中），Kubelet 无法启动容器，导致 Pod 停留在 `ContainerCreating` 状态。\n\n相关证据编号：\n- 挂载失败具体原因：`fact-258ab1cb9337`, `fact-17e97072e3f8`\n- Pod 持续停滞状态：`fact-725956be3194`, `fact-31c26ed34658`\n- 监控状态佐证：`fact-0e9f3a9a30a3`", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v04/workload` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload in aiops-case-v04 is stuck in ContainerCreating/Pending state |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning FailedMount ... MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : secret \"unavailable-input\" not found` (fact-258ab1cb9337) | 核心根因证据：明确报错 Secret 缺失导致挂载失败 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning FailedMount ... Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input], unattached volumes=[input]: timed out waiting for the condition` (fact-17e97072e3f8) | 佐证机制：确认挂载动作因 volume 条件未满足而超时 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | `pod.phase: Pending` (fact-725956be3194) | 现象证据：Pod 因资源/依赖未就绪处于挂起状态 |\n| 4 | K8s State | kubernetes | `pod.condition.ContainersReady: False, reason: ContainersNotReady` (fact-7385412b46cb) | 现象证据：确认容器未进入 Ready 状态 |\n| 5 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason: ContainerCreating` (fact-31c26ed34658) | 现象证据：容器处于等待就绪的中间状态 |\n| 6 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason[reason=\"ContainerCreating\"] = 1` (fact-0e9f3a9a30a3) | 现象佐证：监控确认容器持续处于 ContainerCreating 状态 |\n\n**证据印证**：\nKubernetes 事件直接指出了失败的具体对象是名为 `unavailable-input` 的 Secret，且错误原因为 `not found` (证据 #1, #2)。Pod 的状态数据与指标数据 (证据 #3-6) 一致表明 Pod 停滞在 `ContainerCreating` 和 `Pending` 阶段，未发生任何重试或重启 (restart_count: 0)，这符合因静态配置缺陷（Secret 缺失）导致的不可恢复故障特征。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 的 'input' Volume 引用了不存在的 Secret 'unavailable-input' (Optional: false)\n→ Kubelet 挂载卷时因 Secret 缺失返回 \"not found\" 错误 (FailedMount)\n→ Pod 因依赖卷挂载失败被调度器或 Kubelet 判定为不可启动 (Pending/ContainerCreating)\n→ 用户/集群观测到该 Pod 持续停滞，无法进入 Running 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因：Pod `aiops-case-v04/workload` 声明了对 Secret `unavailable-input` 的挂载依赖，但该 Secret 在集群中不存在。**\n\n根据事实 `fact-258ab1cb9337`，Kubelet 明确记录了 `secret \"unavailable-input\" not found` 的挂载失败事件。由于该 Volume 配置中 `Optional` 标志为 `false`（隐含在 `not found` 导致阻断的行为中），Kubelet 无法启动容器，导致 Pod 停留在 `ContainerCreating` 状态。\n\n相关证据编号：\n- 挂载失败具体原因：`fact-258ab1cb9337`, `fact-17e97072e3f8`\n- Pod 持续停滞状态：`fact-725956be3194`, `fact-31c26ed34658`\n- 监控状态佐证：`fact-0e9f3a9a30a3`"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

