赖，但该 Secret 在集群中不存在。**\n\n根据事实 `fact-258ab1cb9337`，Kubelet 明确记录了 `secret \"unavailable-input\" not found` 的挂载失败事件。由于该 Volume 配置中 `Optional` 标志为 `false`（隐含在 `not found` 导致阻断的行为中），Kubelet 无法启动容器，导致 Pod 停留在 `ContainerCreating` 状态。\n\n相关证据编号：\n- 挂载失败具体原因：`fact-258ab1cb9337`, `fact-17e97072e3f8`\n- Pod 持续停滞状态：`fact-725956be3194`, `fact-31c26ed34658`\n- 监控状态佐证：`fact-0e9f3a9a30a3`\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.1m\n├─ 问题定位: 17.0s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 34.9s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v04/workload: 34.8s (Evidence 27.0s, RCA 7.7s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 12.2s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v04/workload**: pod-volume-mount-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 64.069, "metrics": {"run_id": "6dc4920ad6f244db", "mttr": {"value": "1.1m", "seconds": 64.07486820220947, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-volume-mount-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0